  "content": "<h1>资本，自动运转！</h1><p><em><strong>由无名模组合作组织为您呈现</strong></em></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftstorage.com%252fmods%252fcreate-trading-floor%252fguide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/cakeGit/Create-Trading-Floor/blob/1.20.1/shelf/tradingfloor_banner.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Minecraft Storage 横幅\"></a></p><h2><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7DvmP0f2wXE&amp;ab_channel=SomeGuyCalledCak\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看实际效果！</a></h2><p>简洁直接，<strong>新增交易站方块</strong>，可在机械动力模组中用于与村民进行全天自动交易。该方块配备完整功能，支持 goggles、显示链接、传送带、溜槽与过滤器</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4635c03eeffbe7da1c221f98494c34db2a3039e6.png\" alt=\"村民使用交易站进行交易\"></p>",
